<!--
    Color schemes.

    bg              page background
    surface         passe-partout behind game media and typographic covers
    title           headlines and selected entries
    text            running text such as descriptions
    muted           labels, help prompts, secondary information
    list            unselected list entries
    faint           hairlines
    accent          the single accent: selection marker, rules, captions, stars
    art             system line drawings
    placeholder     line drawing shown in an empty media frame
    ambient         light (dark schemes) or shadow (light schemes) behind the game media
    selectionGlow   the same effect, stronger, marking the selected cover in the grid

    Every scheme has an "atmosphere" twin with the same palette and three additions:
    the light behind the media (and the grid selection) takes the color of the system
    from its metadata (systemColor, defined before this file is included), a soft room
    light of that color sits behind the drawing in the system view, and the game lists
    are backed by the fanart (or screenshot) of the selected game.

    atmosphere      fanart or screenshot behind the game lists: visibility, opacity
                    and saturation
    roomLight       light of the system color in the system view
    listFadeVisible the fade at the right edge of the game list, which only blends
                    into a plain background
-->

<theme>
